Package: FIMSdiags
Title: Diagnostics for FIMS Models
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Megumi", "Oshima", , "megumi.oshima@noaa.gov", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Ian", "Taylor", , "ian.taylor@noaa.gov", role = "aut")
  )
Description: FIMSdiags is a companion package to FIMS. It allows users to take a FIMS model and run common diagnostic analyses on their models. FIMSdiags is in active development and we are continuously adding features and improving current ones.
